<title>FRANCE: Algeria bought 100,000 tonnes Canadian durum-trade.</title>
<headline>Algeria bought 100,000 tonnes Canadian durum-trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria bought 100,000 tonnes of Canadian durum wheat at a September 12 tender, grain traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The wheat is for shipment between the second half of October and the first half of December.</p>
<p>Traders had no pricing details.</p>
<p>Algeria had sought 100,000 tonnes of U.S. and/or Canadian durum wheat for shipment between the second half of October and the first half of December.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
